@startuml
title System Context

actor Player

rectangle "Godot Client" as Client
rectangle "C++20 Game Server" as Server
database "Database" as DB
rectangle "Python Tools / Test Clients" as Tools

Player --> Client : input
Client --> Server : player intentions
Server --> Client : authoritative state updates
Server --> DB : persistence
Tools --> Server : tests / load / validation

note right of Server
Authoritative game state
and simulation
end note
@enduml
